I just wrote this email to support@emu.com who are the people behind my 
E-MU 0404 soundcard, part of the Creative professional products group.

"I need 4 things from you folks so that  a driver can be written for my 
E-MU 0404 to work with my  Linux harddrive;
    * good documentation
    * necessary firmware
    * a way to get additional information if needed
    * example source code is helpful
If your company would like to expand your sales into the growing Linux 
recording market, a good non-Binary only driver needs to be written. If 
you are NOT interested in expanding your customer base, please inform me 
so that I can get rid of this soundcard and go buy a different one that 
works with Linux and the Advanced Linux Sound Architecture project."

Was there anything else I should have added?
Thanks, Dirk
Portland, OR.


